### ============================================
### SETUP — Creeaza date pentru JMeter
### ============================================

### 0. Creeaza userul in emulator (PRIMUL request)
POST http://localhost:5056/api/me/fcm-token
X-Test-User-Id: JLarTgVrk7TX9OKXcL9Nt6qhv4K2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fcmToken": "fake-token-jmeter"
}

### 1. Creeaza Org 1
POST http://localhost:5056/api/organizations
X-Test-User-Id: JLarTgVrk7TX9OKXcL9Nt6qhv4K2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ferma Testarii",
  "description": "Org 1 pentru load testing"
}

###

### 2. Creeaza Org 2
POST http://localhost:5056/api/organizations
X-Test-User-Id: JLarTgVrk7TX9OKXcL9Nt6qhv4K2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Depozit Central",
  "description": "Org 2 pentru load testing"
}

###

### 3. Creeaza Shipment 1 (pune orgId din raspunsul de la Org 1)
POST http://localhost:5056/api/shipments
X-Test-User-Id: JLarTgVrk7TX9OKXcL9Nt6qhv4K2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": "ab669b95-fe1e-47f0-8c22-3423bac8bef8",
  "productName": "Mere Golden",
  "productDescription": "10 lazi",
  "origin": "Cluj",
  "destination": "Bucuresti"
}

###

