### ============================================
### VERIFICARE — Confirma ca datele exista
### ============================================

### GET Organizations — ar trebui sa returneze 2
GET http://localhost:5056/api/organizations
X-Test-User-Id: JLarTgVrk7TX9OKXcL9Nt6qhv4K2

###

### GET Shipments Org 1 — ar trebui sa returneze 3
GET http://localhost:5056/api/shipments?organizationId=ab669b95-fe1e-47f0-8c22-3423bac8bef8
X-Test-User-Id: JLarTgVrk7TX9OKXcL9Nt6qhv4K2

###

